<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank intervening to support crown - dealers.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank intervening to support crown - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) has entered the market to support the crown, intervening when it was at about 3.2 percent level on the depreciation side of its dollar/mark basket midpoint.</p>
<p>&quot;They are intervening, the volumes appear to be medium-sized,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>Another dealer at a foreign bank in Prague confirmed the central bank was on the market.</p>
</text>
